{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "光羲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "光羲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "自漢迄宋凡十二譯"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "楚石句"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二首"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二首"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "蓮公師伯所會大經，家君既為作序，復遣愚姊妹北來就學師門。序尾尚有餘幅，節錄\n師伯舊作於此，以志歸仰。弟子　葛明　錦明　敬識。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "後漢支婁迦讖譯"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一名《無量壽經》一名《阿彌陀經》吳支謙譯"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "曹魏康僧鎧譯"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐菩提流志譯"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "趙宋法賢譯"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法名慈濟"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "敬分章次"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一、國無惡道願。二、不墮惡趣願。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三、身悉金色願。四、三十二相願。五、身無差別願。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六、宿命通願。七、天眼通願。八、天耳通願。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "九、他心通願。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十、神足通願。十一、徧供諸佛願。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十二、定成正覺願。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十三、光明無量願。十四、觸光安樂願。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十五、壽命無量願。十六、聲聞無數願。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十七、諸佛稱嘆願。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十八、十念必生願。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十九、聞名發心願。二十、臨終接引願。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十一、悔過得生願。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十二、國無女人願。二十三、厭女轉男願。二十四、蓮華化生願。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十五、天人禮敬願。\n二十六、聞名得福願。二十七、修殊勝行願。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十八、國無不善願。二十九、住正定聚願。三十、樂如漏盡願。三十一、不貪計身願。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三十二、那羅延身願。\n三十三、光明慧辯願。三十四、善談法要願。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三十五、一生補處願。\n三十六、教化隨意願。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三十七、衣食\n自至願。三十八、應念受供願。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三十九、莊嚴無盡願。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四十、\n無量色樹願。四十一、樹現佛剎願。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四十二、徹照十方願。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四十三、寶香普熏願。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四十四、普等三昧願。四十五、定中供佛願。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四十六、獲陀羅尼願。四十七、聞名得\n忍願。四十八、現證不退願。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "念祖"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "念祖"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "念祖"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "念祖"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "念祖"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "曾著《報恩論》，近代佛學界特出人物也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以上十三句經文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "念祖"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見《悲華經》"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "念祖"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "弟子眾等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "每願一萬元"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "T11n0310_p0092a22"}
{"id": null, "n": "a003a0101", "target": "#nkr_note_add_a003a0101", "type": "add", "text": "CBETA 按：本文錄自《佛說大乘無量壽莊嚴清淨平等覺經會集》（北平萬國道德總會，1947）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0001a0201", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0001a0201", "type": "add", "text": "支【CB】，〔－〕【選集】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0002a0701", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0002a0701", "type": "add", "text": "為教菩薩作阿闍黎常習相應無邊諸行【CB】，〔－〕【選集】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0004b0101", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0004b0101", "type": "add", "text": "匿【CB】，暱【選集】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0007a0101", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0007a0101", "type": "add", "text": "身【CB】，〔－〕【選集】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0014a0201", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0014a0201", "type": "add", "text": "斯【CB】，思【選集】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0019b0501", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0019b0501", "type": "add", "text": "捨【CB】，舍【選集】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0026b0901", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0026b0901", "type": "add", "text": "迴【CB】，廻【選集】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0027a0101", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0027a0101", "type": "add", "text": "斂【CB】，歛【選集】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0030a0401", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0030a0401", "type": "add", "text": "己【CB】，已【選集】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0030b0601", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0030b0601", "type": "add", "text": "己【CB】，已【選集】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0035a0501", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0035a0501", "type": "add", "text": "跏趺【CB】，加跌【選集】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0035b0901", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0035b0901", "type": "add", "text": "己【CB】，已【選集】"}
